    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Yeosapat Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeosapat lokoku ka Asa kilunyokin lokicoloŋ toruwor erwosit a Yudaya. Kitogogoŋ apukan keŋ aŋuna a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak ŋasigarya keŋ lotaunio a Yudaya daadaŋ ŋulu aya ŋaduketa ŋunajiet, kiwuak ŋasigarya nakwap ka lotaunio ŋulu anakwap ke Epuraim ŋulu sek kebu papa keŋ Asa kikama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukito Yeosapat ke Ekapolon, anerae abu iŋes kiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna sek etiyae papa keŋ ekiŋaren, abu iŋes nyelot akilip neni a Baal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai abu kitiyanak Akuj a papa keŋ, kiwuap Ŋakiciketa keŋ, abu nyiwuap ŋuna etiyaete ŋituŋa anakwap a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Ekapolon kitogogoŋ apukan a akwap a Yudaya apaki ŋin ŋina epukator Yeosapat. Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya daadaŋ yaut ŋainakineta neni a Yeosapat, toryamu iŋes ebari ŋolo alalan nooi ka kitopolooroe iŋes nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakina Yeosapat alotau keŋ akiwuap ŋuna ke Ekapolon, abu daŋ iŋes tolema ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur ŋuna elipere ŋakujo, tolema alo Yudaya tari ŋipirin ŋulu arae ŋitorubei a akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiuni ipukat Yeosapat Yudaya, abu kiyakiya ŋikapolok lu ŋulu epukatotor iŋes: Ben-Ail, Obadia, Sakariya, Nesanel ka Mikaia alosit akitatam ŋituŋa alotaunio a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukito ŋituŋa ŋul ka ŋilepi lu: Semaia, Nesania, Sebadia, Asael, Semiramos, Yeonasan, Adoniya, Tobiya ka Tobadoniya. Arukito ŋilepi ŋul ka ŋisacaradotin lu: Elisama ka Yeoram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaasi ikes ekitaabo ŋolo a ŋikisila ke Ekapolon, kitatama ŋituŋa alo Yudaya daadaŋ, toloto lotaunio a Yudaya daadaŋ, kitatama ŋituŋa ŋikisila ŋulu ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kitubul ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ a ŋuna edunyatar Yudaya, aŋun, apotu ikes nyelot akitijiore Yeosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋipilistin ŋice yaut ŋainakineta neni a Yeosapat, yaut esilipa daŋ erae ocur kec, yaut Ŋimarabui ŋakinei neni a Yeosapat; ŋimeesekin ŋalipyo ŋakanikaarei ka ŋamiae ŋakanikaarei, ŋikorwa ŋalipyo ŋakanikaarei ka ŋamiae ŋakanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Yeosapat togogoŋior nooi alokipukae keŋ; abu todukok Yudaya ŋaduketa ŋunajiet ka ŋitaunio ŋulu aya ŋisitowae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Yeosapat kitiya ŋiticisyo ŋulu alalak lotaunio a Yudaya. Ayakar daŋ iŋes Yerusalem ŋikilyok ŋulu adedeŋak ŋulu ayenete ejie ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lo ekimar kec a ŋatekerin: Ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya alo Yudaya a ŋuna atyakatyakatae a ŋalipyo ikes lu: Adina iŋes arae ekarikon a ŋasigarya ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋauni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totupak Yeoanan ŋolo arae ekarikon a ŋasigarya ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikanikauni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totupak Amasia lokoku a Sikiri ŋolo abu tocamu akitiya koŋin aŋuna ke Ekapolon iŋes arae ekarikon a ŋasigarya ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya alo Benjamin ikes lu: Eliada ŋolo erae esigarit ŋolo adedeŋan iŋes arae ekarikon a ŋasigarya ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaarei, ayakatar ŋasigarya keŋ ŋikaleŋeleŋe ka ŋaupala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totupak Yeosabad ŋolo arae ekarikon a ŋasigarya ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomonikanikauni a ŋuna ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulujiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋul ŋikilyok ŋulu etiyaete aŋuna ke erwosit, pa imarakinitae ŋulu abu Yeosapat kiwuak lotaunio ŋulu aya ŋaduketa ŋunajiet alo Yudaya daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
